<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">MY CREATIVE JOURNEY</view><view class="row between"><view class="title">我的作品</view><button class="secondary" bindtap="submit">＋ 投稿</button></view><view class="muted spaced">每一次修改，都离舞台近一点。</view><view wx:if="error" class="error">{{error}}</view><view class="spaced"><view wx:for="{{works}}" wx:key="id" class="card" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="open"><view class="row between"><text class="tag tag-green">{{item.statusText}}</text><text class="muted">{{item.date}}</text></view><view class="work-title">{{item.title}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.genre}} · {{item.typeText}} · 版本{{item.version}}</view><view class="row between spaced"><text class="small">{{item.published ? '已公开正文' : '私密投稿'}}</text><text wx:if="item.total !== null" class="score">{{item.total}}</text><text wx:else class="small">{{item.reviews.length}} / {{item.expertIds.length || 2}} 份评审</text></view></view><view wx:if="!works.length" class="empty"><view>你还没有提交作品。</view><view>唱词、曲谱、清唱小样都可以成为开始。</view></view></view></view>
